«
@@ ============================================================
@@ MGRStoLL — Military Grid Reference System text to latitude and longitude
@@ on the WGS-84 ellipsoid: the centre of the square the text names.
@@ NGA.SIG.0012 (2014), lettering AA; the lowest northing of each latitude
@@ band comes from the same document.
@@
@@ Input : text such as "18T XR 09377 39449"; spaces and case do not
@@         matter.
@@ Output: φ λ — latitude and longitude (East positive).
@@ ============================================================

  "" SWAP
  1 OVER SIZE FOR kk
    DUP kk kk SUB Char→Code
    IF DUP 97 ≥ OVER 122 ≤ AND THEN 32 - END
    IF DUP 32 == THEN DROP ELSE Code→Char ROT SWAP + SWAP END
  NEXT DROP
  → txt
  «
    1 WHILE
      txt OVER DUP SUB Char→Code DUP 48 ≥ SWAP 57 ≤ AND
    REPEAT 1 + END
    → pos
    «
      IF pos 2 < pos 3 > OR txt SIZE pos 2 + < OR THEN
        "Invalid MGRS reference" DOERR
      END
      txt 1 pos 1 - SUB Text→
      txt pos DUP SUB txt pos 1 + DUP SUB txt pos 2 + DUP SUB
      txt pos 3 + txt SIZE SUB
      → zon bnd col row rst
      «
        IF zon 1 < zon 60 > OR rst SIZE 2 MOD 0 ≠ OR rst SIZE 10 > OR THEN
          "Invalid MGRS reference" DOERR
        END
        0 0 0
        "CDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUVWX" → set « 1 set SIZE FOR kk IF set kk kk SUB bnd == THEN ROT DROP kk ROT ROT END NEXT »
        zon 3 MOD 1 == "ABCDEFGH" zon 3 MOD 2 == "JKLMNPQR" "STUVWXYZ" IFTE IFTE
        → set « 1 set SIZE FOR kk IF set kk kk SUB col == THEN SWAP DROP kk SWAP END NEXT »
        "ABCDEFGHJKLMNPQRSTUV"
        → set « 1 set SIZE FOR kk IF set kk kk SUB row == THEN DROP kk END NEXT »
        → ibn ico iro
        «
          IF ibn 0 == ico 0 == OR iro 0 == OR THEN
            "Invalid MGRS reference" DOERR
          END
          rst SIZE 2 /
          → ndg
          «
            10 5 ndg - ^
            → unt
            «
              IF ndg 0 > THEN
                rst 1 ndg SUB Text→ rst ndg 1 + ndg 2 * SUB Text→
              ELSE
                0 0
              END
              → ean nan
              «
                zon ibn 10 ≥ "N" "S" IFTE
                ico 100000 * ean unt * + unt 2 / +
                iro 1 - zon 2 MOD 0 == 5 0 IFTE - 20 MOD 100000 *
                nan unt * + unt 2 / +
                { 1100 2000 2800 3700 4600 5500 6400 7300 8200 9100 0 800 1700 2600 3500 4400 5300 6200 7000 7900 }
                ibn GET 1000 *
                → nmn
                «
                  WHILE DUP nmn < REPEAT 2000000 + END
                »
                ⓁUTM→LL
              »
            »
          »
        »
      »
    »
  »
»
